  "content": {
    "text": "CONCLUDED\nLast Updated:\n22 hours ago\nApple Shares Updates on Child Safety\nApple said on Monday it's working with the American Academy of Pediatrics and other groups to improve child safety features on its devices.\nParents have updated tools to control device time, approve web browsing, and schedule when kids can use certain apps.\nThese updates come as the conversation around child online safety has become a focal point for social media companies.",
